     "solution": "def is_prime(n):\n    if n < 2:\n        return False\n    d = 2\n    while d * d <= n:\n        if n % d == 0:\n            return False\n        d += 1\n    return True\n\nq = int(input())\nfor _ in range(q):\n    print(\"YES\" if is_prime(int(input())) else \"NO\")\n",
